+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - Existing legacy deployment mutators (`MarkRunning`, `MarkSucceeded`, `MarkFailed`, `Cancel`) remain available for current worker/API call sites. New state-machine work should prefer `Transition` so lifecycle changes and deployment_events remain atomic.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - `deployment_events` already has the right append-only tenant-scoped shape for lifecycle history; actor/previous/next/reason can be carried in redacted metadata without a migration.
+  - Adding a stable error code requires updating `internal/errors`, `apienvelope.StatusForCode`, `apierr` taxonomy/constructors, and tests together.
