+  - `ralph/progress.txt`
+- Verification run
+  - `go test ./internal/controlplane/store -run 'TestDeployment(StatusTransitionTable|RepositoryTransition)'` first failed with missing symbols for the new state-machine API and error code, then passed after implementation.
+  - `gofmt -w .`
